Ing tlatah Surakarta lan Ngayogyakarta, ana sisa-sisa karaton &lt;a href="Kasultanan%20Mataram"&gt;Kasultanan Mataram&lt;/a&gt;:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Kuthagedh%C3%A9%2C%20Kutha%20Ngayogyakarta"&gt;Kota Gede&lt;/a&gt; remains of a palace from the 16th century.</li>
