<doc id="72829" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=72829" title="Citizen Kane">
Citizen Kane

Citizen Kane iku &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1941"&gt;1941&lt;/a&gt;, dibintangi déning &lt;a href="Orson%20Welles"&gt;Orson Welles&lt;/a&gt; ing filem dawa pisanané. Ana &lt;a href="rumor"&gt;rumor&lt;/a&gt; yèn carita filem iki dhedhasar marang kauripan sawijining &lt;a href="pebisnis"&gt;pebisnis&lt;/a&gt; misuwur &lt;a href="William%20Randolph%20Hearst"&gt;William Randolph Hearst&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Howard%20Hughes"&gt;Howard Hughes&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Samuel%20Insull"&gt;Samuel Insull&lt;/a&gt;. Welles nuturaké yèn &lt;a href="tokoh%20filem"&gt;tokohé&lt;/a&gt; Kane, dhedhasar punjul sawijining tokoh misuwur. Ing filem &lt;a href="F%20for%20Fake"&gt;F for Fake&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1974"&gt;1974&lt;/a&gt;, panjenengané nuturaké yèn Kane bakal dhedhasar marang Hughes, nanging banjur kailhami déning Hearst.
Amarga filem iki Orson Welles nyambut gawé cerak karo &lt;a href="sinematografer"&gt;sinematografer&lt;/a&gt;é &lt;a href="Gregg%20Toland"&gt;Gregg Toland&lt;/a&gt;. Bebarengan kaloroné nyambut gawé mawa gaya anyar kang jenengé "fokus njero."
Judhul karyané ya iku RKO 281.
Akèh wong kang nyebut Citizen Kane filem paling apik salawasé. Taun &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, manggon ing peringkat angka siji ing pratélan &lt;a href="AFI%27s%20100%20Years...%20100%20Movies"&gt;100 Years... 100 Movies&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="American%20Film%20Institute"&gt;American Film Institute&lt;/a&gt;.
Sajeroning sapérangan babagan filem iki mèmper filem &lt;a href="The%20Power%20and%20the%20Glory"&gt;The Power and the Glory&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1933"&gt;1933&lt;/a&gt;).
Siji-sijiné &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; Kane kang isih urip nganti saiki ya iku &lt;a href="Sonny%20Bupp"&gt;Sonny Bupp&lt;/a&gt;, kang mainaké anak ragil tokoh baku kang jenengé Charles Foster Kane III.
Anggota kru pungkasan kang urip ya iku sutradara &lt;a href="Robert%20Wise"&gt;Robert Wise&lt;/a&gt; (uga ditepungi nggawé filem &lt;a href="The%20Sound%20of%20Music"&gt;The Sound of Music&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1965"&gt;1965&lt;/a&gt;). Panjenengané tilar donya tanggal &lt;a href="14%20September"&gt;14 September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;.
