<doc id="72993" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=72993" title="Odhol">
Odhol

Odhol utawa ing &lt;a href="basa%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;basa Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; pasta gigi nuduhaké barang kanggo sarana reresik &lt;a href="untu"&gt;untu&lt;/a&gt;. Odhol ngandhut deterjen kanggo ngilangi regedan sisa dhaharan utawa &lt;a href="plak"&gt;plak&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Sajarah Odhol</h3>
Sajarah Odhol.
Merek Odhol sing kawiwitan lumebu lan kondhang ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; iku nganggo merk &lt;a href="%27%27Odol%27%27"&gt;Odol&lt;/a&gt;, mula wong-wong saindenging Indonésia nganti tumeka jaman saiki yèn ngarani &lt;a href="pasta%20gigi"&gt;pasta gigi&lt;/a&gt; iku odhol. Miturut literatur odhol cinipta déning priyayi &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; 'Karl August Lingner ing &lt;a href="Dresden"&gt;Dresden&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Ing wektu iku &lt;a href="1892"&gt;1892&lt;/a&gt; Chemical Laboratory &lt;a href="Lingner"&gt;Lingner&lt;/a&gt;, mroduksi Odhol &lt;a href="mouthwash"&gt;mouthwash&lt;/a&gt; lan ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1900an"&gt;1900an&lt;/a&gt; produk reresik untu lan tutuk iki kawentar lan di anggo saindenging &lt;a href="%C3%89ropah"&gt;Éropah&lt;/a&gt;.
aneng peradaban, sarana reresik untu wis di kenal wiwit 5000 taun kapungkur. Jaman &lt;a href="Mesir%20Kuna"&gt;Mesir Kuna&lt;/a&gt; masarakat ing kana gawé odhol sak kuku &lt;a href="sapi"&gt;sapi&lt;/a&gt; lanang sing di gerus, tepung, watu apung lan lebu saka kulit endhog sing di besmi. Déné ing wewengkon &lt;a href="P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Pèrsi&lt;/a&gt;, kira-kira 1000 taun kapungkur gawé bahan saka tetuwuhan lan godhong-godhongan kanggo gawé odhol kang wujud bubuk.
<h3>Karl August Lingner</h3>
Karl August Lingner.
panjenengané miyos tanggal &lt;a href="21%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber%201861"&gt;21 Dhésèmber 1861&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="Magdeburg"&gt;Magdeburg&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Bapaké Lingner ngasta usaha dagang. Panjenengane naté ngasta pagawéan minangka asistèn toko klontong, taun &lt;a href="1883"&gt;1883&lt;/a&gt; panjenengané tindak nagara &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; gladhi musik, nanging ora nemoni asil kang maremake. Taun &lt;a href="1885"&gt;1885&lt;/a&gt; panjenengané kondur menyang nagara asalé &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; ngasta pagawéan juru tulis ing perusahaan konveksi &lt;a href="Seidel%20and%20Nauman"&gt;Seidel and Nauman&lt;/a&gt;. 
Taun &lt;a href="1892"&gt;1892&lt;/a&gt; Lingner kongsi karo &lt;a href="dr.%20Richard%20Seifert"&gt;dr. Richard Seifert&lt;/a&gt; (1861-1919), panjenengané ngasta minangka tenaga pemasaran obat &lt;a href="antis%C3%A8ptik"&gt;antisèptik&lt;/a&gt;. Pengalaman minangka tenaga pemasaran lan kawruh bab &lt;a href="bakteorologi"&gt;bakteorologi&lt;/a&gt; diwujudake Lingner kanthi mroduksi obat reresik tutuk kanthi merek Odol (Odus, Tooth, And Oleum Oil). Kejaba iku, Lingner uga minangka tokoh keséhatan &lt;a href="higienis"&gt;higienis&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenengane ngarsani badan &lt;a href="nirlaba"&gt;nirlaba&lt;/a&gt;, kang konsen ing higienitas. kawiwitan kanthi pameran &lt;a href="Volkskrankheiten"&gt;Volkskrankheiten&lt;/a&gt; (1903), lan pameran internasional taun 1911.
Panjenengane mrakarsani badan-badan kang konsen ing keséhatan, &lt;a href="the%20children%20health%20center%20with%20baby%20home%20ing%20Johannstadt"&gt;the children health center with baby home ing Johannstadt&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%281897%29"&gt;(1897)&lt;/a&gt;, griya saras bayi kang kapisanan ing dunya taun &lt;a href="1898"&gt;1898&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="the%20central%20office%20for%20tooth%20hygiene"&gt;the central office for tooth hygiene&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%281900%29"&gt;(1900)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="the%20public%20central%20office%20for%20disinfection"&gt;the public central office for disinfection&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%281901%29"&gt;(1901)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="the%20desinfektorenschule"&gt;the desinfektorenschule&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%281902%29"&gt;(1902)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="the%20dresdens%20readresounds"&gt;the dresdens readresounds&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%281902%29"&gt;(1902)&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="German%20Hygiene%20Museum"&gt;German Hygiene Museum&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%281912%29"&gt;(1912)&lt;/a&gt;.
Karl August Lingner marak ngarsa Gusti tanggal 5 Juni 1916, sawisé operasi kanker, sadurungé panjenengané bisa mriksani eropa kang maujud dadi nagara kang tentrem
<h3>Bahan Odhol</h3>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Fluoride"&gt;Fluoride&lt;/a&gt;, bahan kanggo nguatke email utawa lapisan untu lan nyegah untu busuk.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="abrasive"&gt;abrasive&lt;/a&gt;, bahan kanggo nyirnakake kotoran kang nemplek ing untu.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Humectants"&gt;Humectants&lt;/a&gt;, bahan supaya kandhutan banyu ing odol ora ilang (glycerol, Propylene, glycol, lan sorbitol).</li>
<li>&lt;a href="zat%20rasa"&gt;zat rasa&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Flavoring%20Agents"&gt;Flavoring Agents&lt;/a&gt;, bahan supaya odol duwé rasa manis, pedes (mint), (sacharine).</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Deterjen"&gt;Deterjen&lt;/a&gt;, zat kang ngasilaké busa utawa foam (lauryl sulfate, sodium N-lauryl sarcosinate).</li>
<li>&lt;a href="zat%20pengental"&gt;zat pengental&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Thikening%20Agents"&gt;Thikening Agents&lt;/a&gt;, bahan kanggo njaga formulasi odol (mineral colloids, natural gums, seaweed colloids utawa synthetic cellullose).</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Triclosan"&gt;Triclosan&lt;/a&gt;, bahan kanggo nyegah baktèri.</li>
</ul>
