Lupus

Lupus ya iku jinising &lt;a href="lelara"&gt;lelara&lt;/a&gt; amarga katahipun &lt;a href="antibodi"&gt;antibodi&lt;/a&gt;, dados antibodine nyerang badhanipun piyambak. Lelara punika diarani lelara &lt;a href="autoimmune%20disease"&gt;autoimmune disease&lt;/a&gt; (lelara kekebalan awak ingkang kathah). Tandha-tandha saka lelara punika sapunika wonten ruam-ruam wonten ing wajah lan lengan, panas lan rasa lelah, &lt;a href="rambut"&gt;rambut&lt;/a&gt; rontok, persendian kerep aboh lan timbul &lt;a href="sariawan"&gt;sariawan&lt;/a&gt;. Penyakit punika saged nyerang kabehane organ wonten awak. Lupus sanès lelara menular. Penderitane boten angsal kena &lt;a href="sreng%C3%A9ng%C3%A9"&gt;srengéngé&lt;/a&gt;. Tandha-tandha saka lelara punika dipuntepangi minangka &lt;a href="Lupus%20Eritomatosus%20Sistemik%28LES%29"&gt;Lupus Eritomatosus Sistemik(LES)&lt;/a&gt; alias Lupus. &lt;a href="Eritomatosus"&gt;Eritomatosus&lt;/a&gt; tegesé kemerahan. Lan &lt;a href="sistemik"&gt;sistemik&lt;/a&gt; tegesé nyebar dateng sadaya organ tubuh. Istilahe dipuntepangi LES utawi Lupus.. Obat saka lelara punika terus dikembangaken. Wonten obat herbal lan obat kimia. &lt;a href="Cellcept"&gt;Cellcept&lt;/a&gt; salah sijining obat sing digunakke kanggo terapi penderita lupus. Cellcept saged ngudunake sistem kekebalane awak. sistem kekebalan awak punika nyerang infeksi saking njawi lan saged ngelawan utawi nolak &lt;a href="transplantasi"&gt;transplantasi&lt;/a&gt; kados &lt;a href="hati"&gt;hati&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="ginjel"&gt;ginjel&lt;/a&gt;. Perkara punika disebabaké sistem kekebalan awak punika memperlakuke organ anyar dadi penyerang. Jinis lelara Lupus punika wonten tiga macem bentuk, kang:
<ul>
<li>Sepindah ya iku &lt;a href="Cutaneus%20Lupus"&gt;Cutaneus Lupus&lt;/a&gt;, kerep mau &lt;a href="discoid"&gt;discoid&lt;/a&gt; kang ngaruhi wacucal.</li>
<li>Ingkang nomer kalih, &lt;a href="Systemic%20Lupus%20Erythematosus%20%28SLE%29"&gt;Systemic Lupus Erythematosus (SLE)&lt;/a&gt; kang menyerang organ tubuh kaya ta &lt;a href="wacucal"&gt;wacucal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="persendian"&gt;persendian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="paru-paru"&gt;paru-paru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="darah"&gt;darah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pembuluh%20darah"&gt;pembuluh darah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jantung"&gt;jantung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ginjel"&gt;ginjel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="hati"&gt;hati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="polo"&gt;polo&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="syaraf"&gt;syaraf&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Ingkang nomer tiga, &lt;a href="Drug%20Induced%20Lupus%28DIL%29"&gt;Drug Induced Lupus(DIL)&lt;/a&gt;, wonten amargi ngginakake usada katamtu. Sesampunipun pemakaian diandeke, racaké tandha-tandha bakal ical.</li>
</ul>
